<title>UK: Barclays plans 2.0 bln Ecu debt programme.</title>
<headline>Barclays plans 2.0 bln Ecu debt programme.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays Bank Plc has applied to set up a 2.0 billion Ecu debt issuance programme, it said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Application has been made to the London Stock Exchange for the securities to be admitted to the Official List,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>Barclays Bank Plc, Barclays Overseas Capital Corporation BV and Barclays Overseas Investment Company BV would all be able to issue bonds under the programme, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
